### 422 VALIDATION_FAILED: bad VIN and email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 0b1c7d52-2f0e-4c55-9d43-31f1a8f5e006

{
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{brakeService}}",
  "startTime": "{{day}}T09:00:00+07:00",
  "channel": "Online",
  "customer": { "name": "Le Van Chi", "email": "not-an-email", "phone": "+84909999999" },
  "vehicle": { "vin": "BAD", "make": "VW", "model": "ID.4", "year": 2023 }
}

### 400 MALFORMED_REQUEST: missing Idempotency-Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### UC-05 Complete the booked appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.id}}/complete

### 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION: a completed appointment cannot be cancelled
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{book.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
